Albedo
======

Configurable vessel activity viewer. Static client-side app.

Setup
-----
make install   Install dependencies (yarn + uv)
make dev       Dev server at localhost:5173

Data Pipeline
-------------
make fetch       GFW API to data/gfw/*.json
make convert     JSON to Parquet
make transform   SQL to data/data.duckdb
make tiles       Export COG heatmaps (aggregate + per-type + per-flag)
make sanctions   Fetch sanctioned MMSIs from OpenSanctions
make export      PMTiles + manifest + i18n + vessel binary data

Deployment
----------
make deploy-data   Upload data files to GCS bucket
make build         Vite production build

Configuration
-------------
Copy .env.example to .env and edit for your region.
Manifest template: manifest.template.json
